{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"regex-cookbook","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Regex Cookbook","description":"Tested regular expressions for emails, URLs, dates, numbers, IDs, passwords, whitespace and more, in every language.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"*","path":"snippets/.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Email\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-email\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^[\\\\\\\\w.+-]+@[\\\\\\\\w-]+(?:\\\\\\\\.[\\\\\\\\w-]+)+$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An email address\"\n  },\n  \"URL\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-url\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"https?://[\\\\\\\\w.-]+(?::\\\\\\\\d+)?(?:/[^\\\\\\\\s]*)?\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An http or https URL\"\n  },\n  \"Domain\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-domain\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^(?:[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?\\\\\\\\.)+[a-z]{2,}$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A domain name\"\n  },\n  \"IPv4\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-ipv4\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\\\\\\\\d|1?\\\\\\\\d?\\\\\\\\d)\\\\\\\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4]\\\\\\\\d|1?\\\\\\\\d?\\\\\\\\d)\\\\\\\\b\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An IPv4 address\"\n  },\n  \"Date ISO\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-date\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\d{4}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\\\\\d|3[01])\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A date, YYYY-MM-DD\"\n  },\n  \"Time 24h\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-time\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(?:[01]\\\\\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\\\\\d(?::[0-5]\\\\\\\\d)?\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A 24 hour time\"\n  },\n  \"Integer\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-int\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[-+]?\\\\\\\\d+\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An integer\"\n  },\n  \"Decimal\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-decimal\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[-+]?\\\\\\\\d*\\\\\\\\.?\\\\\\\\d+(?:[eE][-+]?\\\\\\\\d+)?\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A decimal number\"\n  },\n  \"Hex color\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-hex\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{3}){1,2}\\\\\\\\b\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A hex color\"\n  },\n  \"UUID\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-uuid\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A UUID\"\n  },\n  \"Slug\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-slug\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A URL slug\"\n  },\n  \"Username\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-user\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^[a-zA-Z0-9_]{3,16}$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A username\"\n  },\n  \"Strong password\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-pass\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*\\\\\\\\d).{8,}$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A password with 8+ chars, upper, lower, digit\"\n  },\n  \"Phone (international)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-phone\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^\\\\\\\\+?[1-9]\\\\\\\\d{6,14}$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An international phone number\"\n  },\n  \"Semver\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-semver\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\bv?(\\\\\\\\d+)\\\\\\\\.(\\\\\\\\d+)\\\\\\\\.(\\\\\\\\d+)(?:-([\\\\\\\\w.-]+))?(?:\\\\\\\\+([\\\\\\\\w.-]+))?\\\\\\\\b\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A semantic version\"\n  },\n  \"Whitespace trim\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-trim\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^\\\\\\\\s+|\\\\\\\\s+$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Leading or trailing whitespace\"\n  },\n  \"Blank lines\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-blank\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^\\\\\\\\s*$\\\\\\\\n\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Empty lines\"\n  },\n  \"Multiple spaces\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-spaces\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \" {2,}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Two or more spaces\"\n  },\n  \"HTML tag\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-tag\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"</?([a-zA-Z][\\\\\\\\w-]*)(?:\\\\\\\\s[^>]*)?>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An HTML tag\"\n  },\n  \"Hashtag\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-hashtag\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#[\\\\\\\\p{L}\\\\\\\\p{N}_]+\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A hashtag\"\n  },\n  \"Word\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-word\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[\\\\\\\\p{L}]+(?:'[\\\\\\\\p{L}]+)*\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A word with letters and apostrophes\"\n  },\n  \"Credit card shape\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-card\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\b(?:\\\\\\\\d[ -]?){13,19}\\\\\\\\b\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A 13 to 19 digit card number\"\n  },\n  \"Postal code US\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-zipus\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^\\\\\\\\d{5}(?:-\\\\\\\\d{4})?$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A US ZIP code\"\n  },\n  \"Postal code CA\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-zipca\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"^[ABCEGHJ-NPRSTVXY]\\\\\\\\d[ABCEGHJ-NPRSTV-Z] ?\\\\\\\\d[ABCEGHJ-NPRSTV-Z]\\\\\\\\d$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Canadian postal code\"\n  },\n  \"Quoted string\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-quoted\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A double quoted string\"\n  },\n  \"Line comment\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-comment\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"//.*$\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A // comment\"\n  },\n  \"Camel to words\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-camel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(?<=[a-z0-9])(?=[A-Z])\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The boundary inside camelCase\"\n  },\n  \"Duplicate words\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rx-dupword\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\b(\\\\\\\\w+)\\\\\\\\s+\\\\\\\\1\\\\\\\\b\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A repeated word\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Regex Cookbook\n\nTested regular expressions for emails, URLs, dates, numbers, IDs, passwords, whitespace and more, in every language.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 28 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| * | `rx-email` | An email address |\n| * | `rx-url` | An http or https URL |\n| * | `rx-domain` | A domain name |\n| * | `rx-ipv4` | An IPv4 address |\n| * | `rx-date` | A date, YYYY-MM-DD |\n| * | `rx-time` | A 24 hour time |\n| * | `rx-int` | An integer |\n| * | `rx-decimal` | A decimal number |\n| * | `rx-hex` | A hex color |\n| * | `rx-uuid` | A UUID |\n| * | `rx-slug` | A URL slug |\n| * | `rx-user` | A username |\n| * | `rx-pass` | A password with 8+ chars, upper, lower, digit |\n| * | `rx-phone` | An international phone number |\n| * | `rx-semver` | A semantic version |\n| * | `rx-trim` | Leading or trailing whitespace |\n| * | `rx-blank` | Empty lines |\n| * | `rx-spaces` | Two or more spaces |\n| * | `rx-tag` | An HTML tag |\n| * | `rx-hashtag` | A hashtag |\n| * | `rx-word` | A word with letters and apostrophes |\n| * | `rx-card` | A 13 to 19 digit card number |\n| * | `rx-zipus` | A US ZIP code |\n| * | `rx-zipca` | A Canadian postal code |\n| * | `rx-quoted` | A double quoted string |\n| * | `rx-comment` | A // comment |\n| * | `rx-camel` | The boundary inside camelCase |\n| * | `rx-dupword` | A repeated word |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}